@format 1
@id queue.clear-done
@title Clear completed work
@area 4. Queue and scheduling
@entry input
@summary Confirm and remove durable completed work records from the shared schedule.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related queue.clear-all

@alias console = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Clear Done requested <input>
- Receive the Clear Done command @ console.PConsoleDoneHandle(...)
> confirm

[confirm] Confirm removal <decision>
- Apply the destructive-action confirmation preference @ console.PConsoleDestructiveConfirm(...)
? "Removal is declined" > unchanged
? "Removal proceeds" > clear

[clear] Remove completed records <storage>
- Delete durable done records and reload schedule state @ schedule.LScheduleDoneClear(...)
> result

[result] Completed work cleared <output>
= Completed work records no longer appear in the shared schedule.

[unchanged] Schedule unchanged <output>
= No record is removed.
